# Copter-4.5.5 (stock ArduPilot image) on AirSim SITL — "live checks" variant.
# Loaded LAST in --defaults so these override the image's copter.parm /
# airsim-quadX.parm. Goal: pass pre-arm HONESTLY instead of masking with
# ARMING_CHECK 0, so real GPS/EKF/INS checks stay active.

# --- loop rate ---
# The airsim-copter FDM is lockstepped to AirSim's real-time physics, which
# sustains ~220Hz on one GPU box (300 is unreachable while rendering). Set the
# expected loop rate to 200 so the "Main loop slow" pre-arm passes legitimately
# (220 > 200*0.9) rather than being disabled.
SCHED_LOOP_RATE 200

# --- GPS ---
# AP_GPS_SITL backend: GPS read straight from the sim state (AirSim), healthy
# and low-latency, so the GPS + EKF arming checks can pass on their own.
GPS_TYPE 100
SIM_GPS_NUMSATS 15

# --- EKF ---
EK3_ENABLE 1
EK3_IMU_MASK 3

# NOTE: ARMING_CHECK is deliberately NOT set here — it stays at the Copter
# default (all checks live). This is the whole point of option B: observe what
# remains gating and disable only sim-irrelevant bits (e.g. RC) via a bitmask,
# never 0.
